- Lease or mortgage documents, notices to vacate, rent/utility payment history
- Bank statements, pay stubs, tax returns, credit card records (for financial claims)
- Texts, emails, social media messages, voicemails relevant to disputes
- Photos, videos, medical or police reports, and any photos of property or injuries
- Names and contact information for witnesses
- Any communications from your ex-spouse’s attorney

