- Custody/parenting plans, school records, medical records for children
- Financial records: pay stubs, tax returns, bank statements, credit card statements, bills, proof of assets/debts
- Communication records: texts, emails, social media messages, voicemails relevant to dispute
- Photos, videos, logs/timelines of incidents or dates
- Lease agreements, eviction notices, housing payment records (rent receipts, utility bills)
- Witness contact info and brief statement of what they saw/heard
- Any police reports or protective orders

